<title>USA: Etowah Cty BOE, Ala., won by Robinson-Humphrey.</title>
<headline>Etowah Cty BOE, Ala., won by Robinson-Humphrey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Co, Inc said it won $10.745 million of Etowah County Board of Education, Ala., special tax school warrants, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
